# Everything proxy-related used to need excluding here on purpose — this
# build context used to be the repo root, which meant proxy/ was
# genuinely reachable and had to be kept out by hand. Now that the build
# context is scoped to client/ specifically, proxy/ was never part of this
# context to begin with — nothing left to exclude, this file just got
# simpler as a real side effect of the restructure, not busywork.
